      setting: "Bombay, 1985. India is still under the Licence Raj. Banks lend little to new industry, and most middle-class families keep their savings in gold and fixed deposits.",
      character: "Dhirubhai Ambani, once a petrol pump attendant in Aden, who started trading yarn and spices in 1958 and now runs Reliance, a fast-growing textile company.",
